Honoured sir,

Arrangements for the royal stables accounts are as follows: carts at dawn, th=
e household to follow, and the heavy plate to go by water.

Written in great expedition,
Cardinal Thomas Wolsey

--
Sent from my writing-desk. Pray excuse any brevity or blots.

